Cannot cast `xs` to `Array<number>` because in array element: `string` [1] is not exactly the same as `number` [2].
[incompatible-type]

The above-mentioned two types must be the same because arrays are invariantly typed. To fix the error,
- Either make `Array<string>` [3] and `Array<number>` [4] exactly the same
